From: pogo-bash <pogo-bash@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:02:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 46/46] LibMedia: on Emscripten the null playback stream hands
 its output to the embedder

An embedder that plays audio itself (a page in a browser) registers an
EmbedderAudioOutput: streams created afterwards run at its sample rate,
and each period the null stream pulls is handed to it (interleaved),
with whether the stream plays, its volume and its end. Before, an
AudioContext rendered at wall-clock pace and its output was discarded.
---
